  ],
  "message": "You now hold issue #7 \\"Rate limiting\\". Its step is triage. This step is\\nattended: the user takes part, and you do not decide on your own.\\n\\nInvoke the skill: triage\\nRead the issue: gh issue view 7 --comments\\nOn accept, post what triage established on the issue first: gh issue comment 7\\n\\nWhen the user agrees triage is finished, run one of:\\n  shepherd done 7 accept            (accepted, moves to refinement)\\n  shepherd done 7 reject \\"reason\\"   (closed as not planned; give the reason)\\n\\nOn a long step, run shepherd take 7 again now and then: it keeps your claim fresh.\\nIf you have to stop, run: shepherd release 7\\nIf something is wrong and a person is needed, run: shepherd escalate 7 \\"reason\\"\\n\\nDo not change labels yourself. Only shepherd changes them."
}"
`;

exports[`output of every command, text and --json > take a new issue > text 1`] = `
"exit 0
You now hold issue #7 "Rate limiting". Its step is triage. This step is
attended: the user takes part, and you do not decide on your own.

Invoke the skill: triage
Read the issue: gh issue view 7 --comments
On accept, post what triage established on the issue first: gh issue comment 7

When the user agrees triage is finished, run one of:
  shepherd done 7 accept            (accepted, moves to refinement)
  shepherd done 7 reject "reason"   (closed as not planned; give the reason)

On a long step, run shepherd take 7 again now and then: it keeps your claim fresh.
If you have to stop, run: shepherd release 7
If something is wrong and a person is needed, run: shepherd escalate 7 "reason"

Do not change labels yourself. Only shepherd changes them."
`;

